  "text": "### 8.2 Conflict Resolution  \n**If Conflict Identified:**\n- Escalate to Head of Internal Audit immediately\n- Head of Internal Audit reports to Board Audit Committee\n- Committee decides resolution (reassign audit, external auditor, etc.)\n- Documentation of conflict and resolution  \n---",
